# Outfit body (R18): a rain poncho hanging from the shoulders and widening toward the hem like fabric: shoulder width
# at the top, one voxel wider every few rows down to a broad hem, accent hem band and front stripe, one glow stripe.
# Torso inside x 4..10, y 4..12 (pivot 7 8 0 on spine_03).
name outfit_poncho
grid 5
size 14 16 12
slot cloth SwatchMain
slot hem SwatchAccent
slot glow SwatchGlow
box 0 0 0 14 16 3 cloth
box 1 1 3 13 15 6 cloth
box 2 2 6 12 14 9 cloth
box 3 2 9 11 14 11 cloth
box 4 5 11 10 11 12 cloth
carve box 0 0 0 1 1 3
carve box 13 0 0 14 1 3
carve box 0 15 0 1 16 3
carve box 13 15 0 14 16 3
carve box 4 4 0 10 12 11
carve box 5 6 11 9 10 12
paint box 0 0 0 14 16 1 hem
paint box 6.5 0 0 7.5 16 12 hem
paint box 0 0 4 14 16 5 glow
pivot 7 8 0
